============================================================

The application is primarily for an iPhone user.

Primary target:
iPhone 13.

The user may use it outdoors on a cold late-October evening.

Therefore:

- large touch targets
- obvious controls
- no tiny links
- no tiny icon-only controls unless universally understood and sufficiently large
- generous spacing around important controls
- easy one-handed operation
- important information in natural thumb-reach areas
- minimal horizontal scrolling
- no desktop dashboard simply shrunk to mobile
- short labels
- clear hierarchy
- predictable placement
- fast recognition
- no visual clutter

