The article itself remains the source.

============================================================
16. FIRECRAWL KEYLESS
============================================================

Firecrawl Keyless is the intended supplementary open-web search mechanism.

IMPORTANT:

Use Firecrawl Keyless only as a supplementary discovery/research source.

Do not make the entire application dependent on Firecrawl.

Firecrawl Keyless currently provides web search/scrape without account/API key and automatically provides 1,000 free credits per month.

